This product is a MindSpore re-implementation of the model architecture and
training objectives of the MiniMind project.

MiniMind
  Project:  https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind
  Author:   Jingyao Gong and contributors
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0

The following are used from the upstream project unmodified and are NOT
redistributed in this repository; they are supplied by the user through the
--source_dir argument:

  - the tokenizer files in model/
  - the JSONL datasets in dataset/ (pretrain_t2t_mini, sft_t2t_mini, dpo,
    rlaif, agent_rl_math)
  - pretrained weights, if you continue training from them

No upstream model weights are included in this repository. All source files
here were written for this port; where the upstream design is mirrored
(model configuration, prompt template, dataset field names, training
objectives) the intent is compatibility, not copying, and the attribution
above is retained as required by section 4(c) and 4(d) of the Apache 2.0
licence.

Third-party Python dependencies are covered by their own licences:
MindSpore (Apache 2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), Transformers (Apache 2.0).
